   L6519 ### 23.11 The refusal pattern carries four verdicts, not one
   L6520  §23.10.4 counts refusals and reads them as "a perturbation". The count is one number; the
   L6521  PATTERN is four.
   L6522 
   L6523   refusals                       V          what the family is doing
   L6524   none                           infinite   exact — linear in the parameter, two points suffice
   L6525   none                           finite     a smooth channel
   L6526   one                            finite     a bifurcation — the family changes character and does not return
   L6527   regularly spaced               finite     an oscillation — the family returns
   L6528   dense and irregular            undefine   chaotic
   L6529                                  d
   L6530 
   L6531  **An index does not see *a* refusal. It sees a family**, and the spacing of the refusals across it is what separates these. §16.7.1 makes the same move for a d
   L6532 
